---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'What does Universal Equity Management Solutions do?',
    a: 'We help businesses structure, manage and facilitate their ownership. That covers designing equity frameworks, maintaining cap tables and ESOPs, modelling dilution, and coordinating the equity transactions that let a company bring in capital or change its ownership.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How is equity financing different from a bank loan?',
    a: 'A loan leaves ownership unchanged but must be repaid with interest. Equity financing brings in capital in exchange for shares. There is no repayment schedule, but ownership percentages change. For example, ₹10 Cr invested at a ₹40 Cr pre-money valuation buys 20% of a ₹50 Cr company. We help you understand and structure that trade-off.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Are you an investment bank or a lender?',
    a: 'No. UEMS provides equity advisory, administration and transaction coordination. Where an activity requires a SEBI-registered merchant banker (for example, a public or rights issue), a registered valuer or legal counsel, we work alongside those licensed professionals rather than in place of them.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Which businesses do you work with?',
    a: 'We are industry-agnostic: high-growth SaaS companies, asset-heavy manufacturers, multi-entity healthcare networks, franchise retail chains and professional-services firms, from founder-led startups to promoter-run family businesses.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Where do you operate?',
    a: 'Our offices are in Hyderabad, Mumbai and Bangalore, and we support engagements across India.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do we get started?',
    a: 'Book a 15-minute introductory session with our equity specialists. We will understand your current ownership and capital needs, then propose a clear scope before any engagement begins.',
  },
];
---
<section class="faq" data-theme="light" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="wrap faq__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow" data-fade>FAQ</p>
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="h-display" data-reveal>
        <span class="split-line"><span>Questions,</span></span>
        <span class="split-line"><span><em>answered.</em></span></span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq__list">
      {faqs.map((f, i) => (
        <details class="qa" open={i === 0} data-fade={i * 0.04}>
          <summary data-cursor="Learn +">
            <span>{f.q}</span>
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <p>{f.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq {
    padding: clamp(110px, 13vw, 180px) 0;
  }
  .faq__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.7fr 1.3fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 100px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .faq__list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .qa {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .qa summary {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 24px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 22px);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--forest);
  }
  .qa summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .qa summary i {
    position: relative;
    flex: none;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
    transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.5s var(--ease);
  }
  .qa summary i::before,
  .qa summary i::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 12px;
    height: 1.5px;
    margin: -0.75px 0 0 -6px;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .qa summary i::after {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
    transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease);
  }
  .qa[open] summary i {
    background: var(--forest);
    color: var(--ivory);
  }
  .qa[open] summary i::after {
    transform: rotate(0deg);
  }
  .qa p {
    margin: 0 0 26px;
    max-width: 62ch;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .faq__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
